{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "004ter_303_2_3_004_03_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:43a02a5f9eef41b4e54e0724d37fd6e2728df29077df30d6be228b0d2bde78e6",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:004ter_303_2_3_004_03_09_a:2_3_004_03_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38e6d7acf8bff94f8e93824a05c1b98316f445ec310190115e1774fbb677c36f",
      "text": "喂，●●●●プロデューサー！\n现在稍微方便聊会儿吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:004ter_303_2_3_004_03_09_a:2_3_004_03_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e3e3bac30e81f848af9d6f1b313db1ab67daa1691c795dd403cb83279adfd20",
      "text": "之前不是接了巧克力的工作嘛。就是我演怪盗的那个。\n翼和樱庭跟我说了他们的感想哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:004ter_303_2_3_004_03_09_a:2_3_004_03_09_a:cmd-000010:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c07e3d2b203673fd80bfe16e06edfef15eb1b8d5cbf7ab4a8ac9edd4f0558eb0",
      "text": "薰先生说了什么感想呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:004ter_303_2_3_004_03_09_a:2_3_004_03_09_a:cmd-000011:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d8d7aa8daf3051784eb258e814add8e3ed22d47267a834df45702685843d696",
      "text": "翼先生说了什么感想呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:004ter_303_2_3_004_03_09_a:2_3_004_03_09_a:cmd-000013:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3309245457ee85ebaf900189bd45e95eacefd8dbd7852c25afb2eecdd7e78652",
      "text": "听着不知道算不算在夸我，怪可疑的呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:004ter_303_2_3_004_03_09_a:2_3_004_03_09_a:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:444fb7a69f96b5c235a08d38b772c2b97953ed6ddbd904eb39c3b0e16161533d",
      "text": "他夸我很帅气哦。\n被这么坦率地当面夸奖，怪不好意思的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:004ter_303_2_3_004_03_09_a:2_3_004_03_09_a:cmd-000021:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:411503b992052253a1b5e9ed5acf080591176d8e096bbbcfcfcd7ad17bb2485d",
      "text": "像这样，樱庭和翼能去看我的工作，\n果然还是……挺让人高兴的啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:004ter_303_2_3_004_03_09_a:2_3_004_03_09_a:cmd-000023:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e6daee05fa06b3244e84af1547d717c58123ead495c7f5f079d39893e4723d8",
      "text": "很想跟谁聊聊，不知不觉就打给制作人了。\n明明也没什么正事，抱歉啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:004ter_303_2_3_004_03_09_a:2_3_004_03_09_a:cmd-000025:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84dd7115444593f8ec5adbe9469e2eb9a8e432619c5a8f65762a8f65daeae66d",
      "text": "能听到这件事\n我很开心！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:004ter_303_2_3_004_03_09_a:2_3_004_03_09_a:cmd-000026:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43bc0afddaf5ed9336bbfdb580a6182631f96ec32d9ae9e64593d97d845f2e69",
      "text": "我也觉得\n心情变愉快了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:004ter_303_2_3_004_03_09_a:2_3_004_03_09_a:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1336c759f971662c1a01f60d6585d793a1c7db3666873ecee4e4bda86b8fbf0e",
      "text": "嘿嘿……这样啊，谢啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:004ter_303_2_3_004_03_09_a:2_3_004_03_09_a:cmd-000030:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7da560ebb136cd607c66de557ef281f1620788404cb49f490cfe246de74fe86",
      "text": "樱庭和翼也在做各种工作对吧。\n为了我也能说出感想，得好好关注才行！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:004ter_303_2_3_004_03_09_a:2_3_004_03_09_a:cmd-000032:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:035e84692037f066cf86eba79b3dad4da32094305a6101bf69748b85e0875ba3",
      "text": "要是冷不防跟他们说感想，那帮家伙会露出\n怎样的表情呢？我现在就开始期待两个人的反应了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:004ter_303_2_3_004_03_09_a:2_3_004_03_09_a:cmd-000034:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5791329ec51a5f53c036799ba641d738d0bb75d4b1a401e3e72bfc22222b2620",
      "text": "谢谢你听我说话！\n那就这样，辛苦啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
